WHAT THIS COVERS

  The stylesheets in src/assets/css/, the templates and data files, and the
  writing throughout the site.


WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER

  The colour ramps in profile/primitives/colors.css are Tailwind CSS v4's
  neutral, blue, green, amber and red scales, recorded as published. Tailwind
  is MIT licensed, Copyright (c) Tailwind Labs, Inc.

  The semantic colour families follow Radix Colors' twelve-step scheme, named
  rather than numbered. The scheme is the idea, not the values; Radix is MIT
  licensed, Copyright (c) WorkOS.

  resets/modern-reset.css is adapted from Andy Bell's "A more modern CSS reset"
  and Josh W. Comeau's "custom CSS reset", both published openly and credited
  in the file itself.
